OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit closure 'becoming a
OL,4,Anightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ongoing maternity unit closure is
OL,7,F"becoming a nightmare", an expectant
OL,8,Fcouple says.
OL,10,FBirthing services at North Devon
OL,11,FDistrict Hospital (NDDH) in Barnstaple
OL,12,Fhave been closed since 11 August due to
OL,13,Fstaffing issues, meaning pregnant women
OL,14,Fface a 53-mile (85km) trip to Exeter to
OL,15,Fgive birth just from the Barnstaple
OL,16,Farea.
OL,18,FThere was a provisional reopening date
OL,19,Fof 29 September. Bosses have since said
OL,20,Fthe service was not in a position to
OL,21,Freopen.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
