OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit closure 'becoming a
OL,4,Anightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSean and his partner Amy, who is 36
OL,7,Fweeks pregnant, live in Hartland with
OL,8,Ftheir three-year-old son. The father
OL,9,Fsaid they went through a birth plan at
OL,10,FNDHH last week as they were expecting
OL,11,Fservices to resume, but were now
OL,12,Fworried what was to happen.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
